{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1470984-scion-2e-on-foundry-vtt","id":1470984,"title":"Scion 2E on Foundry VTT!","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-12-20T22:30:34-08:00","id":1470984,"title":"Scion 2E on Foundry VTT!","content":"By <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/over-paths-we-go-laughing-all-the-way-monday-meeting-notes/\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Monday Meeting Notes</b></a>, <b>Scion</b> goes <a href=\"https://foundryvtt.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Foundry VTT</a>!<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#555555\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">\u201cFoundry Virtual Tabletop is a self-hosted roleplaying<br /> platform with support for hundreds of game systems with modern features and a developer-friendly API. Foundry VTT is a one-time purchase where your players connect for free using a web browser.\u201d</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#555555\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">We\u2019re offering first the character sheet for <b>Scion Origin </b>and <b>Hero</b>, featuring:</span></span></span><ul><li>A whole platform as a new place for Storyguides and Players</li> <li>Fully integrated and up to date character sheet</li> <li>Familiar to users of the paper sheet</li> <li>Handles all needed rolls</li> <li>Officially created and supported</li> </ul><span style=\"color:#555555\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">More VTT offering and projects will be arriving next year!<br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/12/eric_donner_image.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></span></span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 12-21-2021, 01:33 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-12-20T22:32:02-08:00","id":1470985,"title":"","content":"Some questions I have as game's fan:<br /> <br /> <b>Will official Scion 2E sheet for Foundry will have Antagonists section - or alternate sheets? Antagonists are using different sheets than normal PCs in game.</b><br /> <br /> It was dearly missed in unofficial one on Roll20, so I needed to programmed that myself, to run normal fights on it, with stats written in corebooks for Antagonists.<br /> <br /> P.S. <b>When we can look for Realms of Pugmire support on Foundry?</b>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-12-21T16:55:05-08:00","id":1471054,"title":"","content":"I have been thinking about the possibility/needing of a Character Creation app... But honestly, Storypath is so narrative for that I don't see it as must or even a help. Might be helpful to keep the sheets and characters saved and organized though, but, literally... just that.<br /> <br /> I'm seriously wondering about the possibility to buy Foundry soon though...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23841-hayashi","name":"Hayashi","avatar":"htt